1,178,27.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "jyotismant": [{"id": "jyotizmant", "headword": "ज्योतिष्मन्त्", "headword_slp1": "jyotizmant", "fold": "jyotismant", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "ज्यो꣫तिष्मन्त्\n— 1〉 Adj. (f. ˚ष्मती)\n — a〉 lichtvoll, licht, leuchtend, der Lichtwelt angehörend, himmlisch.\n — b〉 lichtvoll, so v. a. rein geistig.\n— 2〉 m.\n — a〉 die Sonne DAŚAK. 84,11.\n — b〉 eine best. Sonne.\n — c〉 Bez. des dritten Fusses von Brahman.\n — d〉 N. pr.\n — α〉 verschiedener Männer.\n — β〉 eines Gebirges.\n— 3〉 f. ˚ष्मती f.\n — a〉 *Nacht RĀJAN. 21,44.\n — b〉 ein best. Backstein.\n — c〉 eine best. Form der Triṣṭubh.\n — d〉 Cardiospermum halicacabum RĀJAN. 3,70.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["ज्योतिष्मत्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["jyotizmat"]}], "jyotisya": [{"id": "jyotizya", "headword": "ज्योतिष्य", "headword_slp1": "jyotizya", "fold": "jyotisya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "ज्योतिष्य॑ Adj. unter Beleuchtung befindlich TS. 6,4,2,2; vgl. Comm. 1,554,8. fgg.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "jyotiHswoma": [{"id": "jyotiHzwoma", "headword": "ज्योतिःष्टोम", "headword_slp1": "jyotiHzwoma", "fold": "jyotiHswoma", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "ज्यो꣫तिःष्टोम m. eine best. Soma-Feier.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "jyotiHswomika": [{"id": "jyotiHzwomika", "headword": "ज्योतिःष्टोमिक", "headword_slp1": "jyotiHzwomika", "fold": "jyotiHswomika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "ज्योतिःष्टोमिक Adj. von ज्योतिःष्टोम.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "jyotis": [{"id": "jyotis", "headword": "ज्योतिस्", "headword_slp1": "jyotis", "fold": "jyotis", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "ज्यो꣫तिस्\n— 1〉 n.\n — a〉 Sg. und Pl. Licht, Helle, Schein, Feuer (MEGH.); त्री꣫णि ज्यो꣫तींषि die drei Lichter, d. i. die Erscheinung des Lichtes in den drei Weltgebieten. Personificirt als Feuer, Wind und Sonne. ज्यो꣫तिष्कर् beleuchten.\n — b〉 Mondschein ṚV. 3,34,4. AV. 4,18,1.\n — c〉 Augenlicht.\n — d〉 Auge.\n — e〉 Pl. die Gestirne. Du. Sonne und Mond.\n — f〉 das Licht der himmlischen, ewigen Welt, diese Lichtwelt selbst.\n — g〉 das Licht als das himmlische Lebensprincip in den Geschöpfen, die Intelligenze in den vernünftigen Wesen. पर das höchste Licht, so v. a. die höchste Intelligenz, der höchste Geist, die höchste Wahrheit.\n — h〉 das Licht als Bild für ungehemmtes Leben, Freiheit, Freude; Hülfe, Heil, Sieg.\n — i〉 Bez. verschiedener Ekāha.\n — k〉 Bez. bestimmter Sprüche, welche das Wort ज्योतिस् enthalten. []\n — l〉 ein best. Metrum.\n — m〉 = ज्योतिष 4〉.\n — n〉 mystische Bez. des Lautes र.\n— 2〉 m.\n — a〉 *Feuer.\n — b〉 *die Sonne.\n — c〉 *Trigonella foenum-graecum^1.\n — d〉 N. pr.\n — α〉 eines Marut.\n — β〉 eines Sohnes des Manu Svārociṣa.\n — γ〉 eines Prajāpati VP.² 3,5.\n[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk, Thomas Malten on 20241207. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/PWK/issues/111.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "jyotistatva": [{"id": "jyotistattva", "headword": "ज्योतिस्तत्त्व", "headword_slp1": "jyotistattva", "fold": "jyotistatva", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "ज्योतिस्तत्त्व n. Titel eines astr. Werkes.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "jyotiHsagara": [{"id": "jyotiHsAgara", "headword": "ज्योतिःसागर", "headword_slp1": "jyotiHsAgara", "fold": "jyotiHsagara", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "ज्योतिःसागर m. Titel eines astr. Werkes.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "jyotisat": [{"id": "jyotissAt", "headword": "ज्योतिस्सात्", "headword_slp1": "jyotissAt", "fold": "jyotisat", "headword